# Draw & Roll test session. Format: see tools/smoke.touch and docs/testing.md.
#   tap T SLOT X Y | hold T DUR SLOT X Y | drag T DUR SLOT X0 Y0 X1 Y1 | wave T DUR SLOT CX CY R TURNS | fuzz T DUR N
# 1. tap the cloud: a ball drops
tap    20 0 480 100
# 2. three fingers draw ramps at once (different colours), one more scribbles a loop
drag   44 46 0 170 150 420 290
drag   52 52 1 790 140 560 275
wave   66 70 2 255 345 60 1.3
drag   84 44 3 640 90 760 200
# 3. a tap on empty sky just sparkles; the cloud again and again; a held finger; a short drag
tap   120 4 330 120
tap   140 5 480 105
hold  150 40 6 620 380
drag  156 40 7 360 330 470 400
tap   176 8 500 105
tap   196 9 470 100
# 4. ten fingers scribble at once (slots 0-9)
fuzz  248 52 10
# 5. the sponge (slot 12 is free of the scribbling fingers) washes everything away
tap   290 12 108 462
